      "question": "Curve C has equation y = f(x), where f(x) is a quadratic with minimum point (7, -18) and roots at x = 4 and x = k. Find f(x).",
      "status": "ready",
      "answer": "f(x) = 2x^2 - 28x + 80",
      "steps": [
        "Write f(x) = a(x - 4)(x - 10) using the roots 4 and 10.",
        "At x = 7, f = -18: a(3)(-3) = -18, so -9a = -18 and a = 2.",
        "f(x) = 2(x - 4)(x - 10) = 2(x^2 - 14x + 40).",
        "So f(x) = 2x^2 - 28x + 80."
